Trust this WordOllama.JS HTTPS server certificate in your current-user certificate store?

Purpose: secure the local Desktop Bridge connection only
Names: localhost, 127.0.0.1 and ::1
SHA-256 fingerprint: {0}
Expires: {1:g}

It cannot issue other certificates, is never installed machine-wide, and will be removed when you uninstall WordOllama.JS.

Install WordOllama.JS for the current user?

Version: {0}
Install location: {1}

Setup installs the Desktop Bridge and registers the Microsoft Word and WPS Writer add-ins. It also creates a current-user certificate restricted to localhost, 127.0.0.1, and ::1 to secure the local connection. The certificate is removed during uninstall.

Select Yes to start installation.
